1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
SybilShield turns a social handle into a staked credential passport.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Free vouches and copied proof pages make reputation trivially farmable.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Applicants lock real SST. Peers vouch with real stake.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
A challenger locks a bond equal to the stake before verification.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Validators fetch the proof page and must agree on three fields.

6
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Anchor 100 is Diamond Human. Anchor 75 is Verified Contributor.

7
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Anchor 40 stays provisional. Anchor 0 slashes the stake.

8
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Every liability stays in vault custody until settlement is claimed.

9
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Live on studionet: 18 finalized transactions and 3 guard rollbacks.

10
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Four way sha256 match. github.com/hoveiser/sybil-shield
